---@field minTlsCipherSuite? azure.web.TlsCipherSuites The minimum strength TLS cipher suite allowed for an application
---@field scmMinTlsVersion? azure.web.SupportedTlsVersions ScmMinTlsVersion: configures the minimum version of TLS required for SSL requests for SCM site
---@field ftpsState? azure.web.FtpsState State of FTP / FTPS service
---@field preWarmedInstanceCount? number Number of preWarmed instances. This setting only applies to the Consumption and Elastic Plans
